      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m a little confused.\n\nBefore this change, if the makefile specified \"dalvik.vm.madvise.artfile.size\u003d...\" then we would madvise as much, otherwise we would not madvise anything (the default in `runtime_options.def` is 0). Correct?\n\nWith this change, we are introducing a new flag `disable_madvise_artfile_default`.\nIf the flag is set, IIUC nothing changes from the previous behavior. That is to say, if the makefile specifies a value then we use it, otherwise it\u0027s 0.\nIf the flag is not set, we still respect a value from the makefile if provided, otherwise we set 4294967295. Is this correct?",
      "revId": "50d286a4eaf33925c40ce7610f255108441e6b01",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
